OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why the UK economy is
OL,4,Asurprisingly resilient
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK economy grew at its fastest rate
OL,7,Ffor more than two years in the three
OL,8,Fmonths to September.
OL,10,F"Top gear" and "strikingly strong" were
OL,11,Famong the descriptions of the 0.7%
OL,12,Fgrowth offered by the economists who
OL,13,Ftrack every minor murmur of Britain's
OL,14,Feconomy.
OL,16,FIt is an upgrade on "solid" and
OL,17,F"resilient", and in turn a world away
OL,18,Ffrom "hardest hit by the Iran War".
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
